# The Khronos "Car Concept" glTF model (CC-BY 4.0, Eric Chadwick / Darmstadt
# Graphics Group; tools/fetch_models.sh downloads it) under the quarry HDRI,
# with the low sun behind it on the right: rim light along the body and a long
# shadow towards the camera. The materials come from the glTF file (see
# gltf_loader.h); its clearcoat is not supported yet, so the paint has only
# its base layer.

image_width  960
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 256
max_depth    16

camera lookfrom 5.5 1.6 6.5  lookat 0 0.55 0.2  vfov 30

environment ../textures/quarry_01_1k.hdr  rotate 40
exposure    -1
tonemap     aces

material asphalt principled color 0.35 0.35 0.35 roughness 0.5
ground asphalt

mesh ../models/external/CarConcept.glb
